  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.2242 specifies a method of coordinating existing and ongoing works on service function chaining in mobile networks (specified in [IETF RFC 7665], [IETF RFC 8300] and [b‑ONFTS-027]) by introducing a chain orchestrator as a new entity. Recommendation ITU-T Y.2242 also covers the case when relevant network functions are virtualized.Recommendation ITU-T Y.2242 aims to describe the requirements, architecture, functional entities, reference points and information flows of service function chaining in mobile networks.</abstract>
